                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            Arthavi automatically computes realized LTCG and STCG whenever you redeem mutual funds or sell stocks. It accounts for holding periods, applies Section 112A equity grandfathering rules (using Jan 31, 2018 FMV prices), and uses the updated tax slabs (12.5% for LTCG with ₹1.25L exemption, 20% for STCG). You can download an Excel or CSV file directly formatted for your Chartered Accountant or ITR filing.
                        </div>
